  {
    "id": "7ca48d7033cfb652",
    "text": "The River Valley Old Maintenance Depot site has been cleared: a maintenance robot with a broken drive shaft was sealed with lead and stored underground, while surviving records and usable parts were duly entered into local stores. The device is not currently operational."
  },
  {
    "id": "30438d7223c0ca9e",
    "text": "The River Valley Old Maintenance Depot has been fully dismantled and inventoried. All recovered structural steel and components have been allocated to the local public warehouse. The ruins have been cleared and will yield no further secondary building materials."
  },
  {
    "id": "9f8df5c5ae94a22d",
    "text": "Survey team members found a nest of mutated beetles deep in the maintenance passage. Given the access conditions at the Old Maintenance Depot, a practical on-site response plan must be decided urgently."
  },
  {
    "id": "ac208c77cbd7c901",
    "text": "The isolation passage at the Old Maintenance Depot has been safely cleared. Leadership must decide whether to preserve the core equipment and records on site or dismantle it completely for salvage."
  },
  {
    "id": "18e43050bc50539e",
    "text": "An old maintenance depot outside River Valley City has broken pipes and signs of activity; it has not yet been surveyed"
